Hi, all:

Where could I find TODO list for bluez-gnome? In wiki.bluez, I only  
found the TODO list for the bluez-utils and kernel, and it seem be  
very old.

I would like to make the bluez-gnome more friendly. For example, the  
connect button in Browse is kindly confused for users since it only  
working for OBEX. I think an extra page should be used to display  
remote services and let user choose one. However, I don't know if it  
follows the original design of bluez-gnome. Anyone could tell me where  
I could find some information about that.

If possible, I plan to complete the setting interfaces for  
HID/SPP/DUN/HFP/HSP first since most bluetooth devices are from these  
profiles. thanks.

Regards, Mihs

